<title>SWITZERLAND: TENNIS-WOMEN'S EUROPEAN INDOOR CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WOMEN'S EUROPEAN INDOOR CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the women's</p>
<p>European indoor tennis championships on Tuesday (prefix denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Karina Habsudova (Slovakia) beat Marketa Kochta (Germany) 6-3</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Barbara Schett (Austria) beat Helena Sukova (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>6-4 2-6 6-2</p>
<p>Lisa Raymond (U.S.) beat Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) 6-2 7-5</p>
<p>Judith Wiesner (Austria) beat Nathalie Tauziat (France) 0-6 6-4</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>5-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat Naoka Sawamatsu (Japan) 6-0</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>Jennifer Capriati (U.S.) beat Gabriela Sabatini (Argentina) 6-3</p>
<p>6-4</p>
</text>
